    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce00ff49fe58b5bac8d42272",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会场内的气氛热烈异常。\n这仿佛连天空都为之沸腾的兴奋程度，\n仅会出现在名留青史的精彩比赛中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e65b8b8bdb627ebca3a8d03dcf569525259a3c77e21ca18b95be3b23d7ce40d",
